      "content": "Take a deep breath. You are doing just fine, and we can break this down into small, manageable steps together. You've already got the data in order, which is the most important first step! \n\nTo start the box and whisker plot, we need the median. Since there are 9 numbers, the median is the 5th value. Looking at your list, what is the middle number?"
